---
// ProblemSection.astro
---
<section id="problem" class="section bg-secondary">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">THE PROBLEM</span>
      <h2>Your users shouldn't be your error monitoring</h2>
      <p class="subtext">Most teams find out about API failures from angry customers, not their monitoring tools. By then, the damage is done.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="problem-grid reveal-stagger">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon">🔔</div>
        <h3>Alert Fatigue</h3>
        <p>Drowning in noise from tools that cry wolf. When everything is critical, nothing is.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon">🕐</div>
        <h3>Slow Detection</h3>
        <p>Minutes between failure and detection. Your users feel it before your dashboards show it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-icon">🧩</div>
        <h3>Scattered Tooling</h3>
        <p>Status page here, logs there, metrics somewhere else. No single source of truth for API health.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bg-secondary {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);
  }
  .section {
    padding: 64px 0;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .subtext {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .problem-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 32px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 var(--card-highlight), var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: transform var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-out-expo), box-shadow var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-out-expo), border-color var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-out-expo);
  }
  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 var(--card-highlight), var(--shadow-md);
    border-color: var(--color-border-hover);
  }
  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .card p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
